<title>HUNGARY: CESI index hits new record of 1,626.46 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index hits new record of 1,626.46 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index gained 13.38 points or 0.83 percent to finish at a new record high of 1,626.46 points on Friday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
